# Smart Attendance Management System

A web-based attendance system for colleges. Faculty mark attendance; students
view their attendance percentage. Built with Spring Boot and MySQL.

## Features
- Student and attendance record management (JPA + MySQL)
- REST API for marking and querying attendance
- Per-student attendance percentage calculation
- ML-based prediction of students at risk of low attendance
